# Reference material dropped in the project root while building against it —
# the Culture and Arts Development Manual and the BatStateU-WI-OCA-* Work
# Instructions. The rules they define live in app/Support/; the source PDFs
# themselves are large binaries and are not part of the application.
/*.pdf
/*.docx
/CODE_REVIEW_AND_FEATURE_PROPOSAL.md
/TRAINER_ROLE_BUILD_PROMPT.md

# Local uploads (profile photos) — user data, same as documents above.
/public/uploads/profile_photos/*
!/public/uploads/profile_photos/.gitkeep
